# Runtime

This process is not a product. It creates prefixes, sets env, spawns the Windows exe, and collects logs.

- Assume the backend binary (Wine / CrossOver / GPTK eval) is **injected by config**, not compiled in.
- Never require the user to run winecfg or Winetricks.
- Persist shader/PSO caches outside throwaway prefix dirs when possible.
- Crash = wrap the translation-stack log in a Mogged report; do not show raw Wine traces in the UI.
- Do not vendor GPTK. Do not copy CrossOver.app into this tree.
